{"4218570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bird Game 5", "steam_appid": 4218570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Bird Game 5</strong>, birds battle for control using their unique skill sets. Whether you’re a speedy hummingbird, a tanky shoebill, or a tactical eagle, the goal is clear: Pick a bird. Master their skills. Bring home the eggs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Unique Bird Heroes</strong> – Each bird comes with unique abilities, offering a wide range of playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Team-Based Aerial Combat</strong> – Fast, vertical, chaotic battles where skilled ability use is everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Gamemode </strong>– Work as a team in Capture the Egg.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Proximity Chat</strong> – Communicate coordinated plans with your teammates, or taunt your enemies while you fly off with their egg!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Original Soundtrack</strong> – Experience a bird-themed soundtrack while chasing your next win.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Bird Game 5</strong>, birds battle for control using their unique skill sets. Whether you’re a speedy hummingbird, a tanky shoebill, or a tactical eagle, the goal is clear: Pick a bird. Master their skills. Bring home the eggs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Unique Bird Heroes</strong> – Each bird comes with unique abilities, offering a wide range of playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Team-Based Aerial Combat</strong> – Fast, vertical, chaotic battles where skilled ability use is everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Gamemode </strong>– Work as a team in Capture the Egg.</p><p class=\"bb_